      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "code": { "language": "markdown", "showLineNumbers": false, "showMiniMap": false },
        "content": "## Harness / Temporal — \n\nCovers the three availability signals the consultation-session-workflow assessment names as decisive for whether `HarnessDocWorkflow` can safely become the sole clinical-documentation generator (design.md D1): harness 5xx rate, generation latency percentiles, and Temporal server reachability. The fourth signal — duplicate `harness-doc-{consultationId}` executions — is not a continuous metric and is not on this dashboard; run `scripts/harness-availability-report.py` for that report (see `` §4 Task 4).\n\n**Two Temporal instances exist in production and this dashboard cannot tell you which one you're looking at without checking `TEMPORAL_ADDRESS` yourself:** the harness/harness-worker deployments point at an unmanaged VM (`10.10.1.10:7233`); a separate, currently-unused in-cluster `hope-temporal` Deployment also exists and is what production Prometheus currently scrapes under `job=\"temporal\"`. Locally (this dashboard's default datasource) the `temporal` job is the dev-stack's own single Temporal container — there is no VM-vs-in-cluster ambiguity in local dev. See `README.md` §2.10 before trusting a `temporal` job label in any other environment.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "hope-prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.02 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 0.05 }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "percentunit"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 4 },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "hope-prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_requests_total{service=\"harness\",status=~\"5..\"}[5m])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(http_requests_total{service=\"harness\"}[5m])), 0.001)",
          "legendFormat": "5xx rate",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Harness 5xx rate",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "hope-prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "mappings": [
            { "options": { "0": { "color": "red", "text": "DOWN" }, "1": { "color": "green", "text": "UP" } }, "type": "value" }
          ],
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "red", "value": null }, { "color": "green", "value": 1 }] }
        }
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 4 },
      "id": 3,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
